init_semantics_statement=∀start s off max_heap k jump gen_gc data_sp coracle code bitmaps. lookup stack_err_lab s.code = SOME (halt_inst 2w) ∧ code_rel jump off k code s.code ∧ init_pre gen_gc max_heap bitmaps data_sp k start s ∧ s.compile_oracle = (I ## MAP (prog_comp jump off k) ## I) ∘ coracle ∧ (∀n i p. MEM (i,p) (FST (SND (coracle n))) ⇒ reg_bound p k ∧ num_stubs ≤ i + 1) ⇒ case evaluate (init_code gen_gc max_heap k,s) of (NONE,t) => semantics 0 s = semantics start t ∧ ∃r. make_init_opt gen_gc max_heap bitmaps data_sp coracle jump off k code s = SOME r ∧ state_rel jump off k r t | (SOME v5,t) => F
